OL,3,GNEWSACouncil halts sale of 'tiny' park
OL,4,Aafter outcry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to auction off a "tiny" park has
OL,7,Fbeen put on hold by a council following
OL,8,Fpressure from residents and
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FA 'For Sale' sign had gone up on a
OL,12,Fsmall patch of grass on Water Street in
OL,13,FGreat Harwood.
OL,15,FThe small parcel of land, surrounded by
OL,16,Fterraced houses, was put on the market
OL,17,Fwith a starting price of #50,000 by
OL,18,FHyndburn Council.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
