OL,3,GNEWSACouncil halts sale of 'tiny' park
OL,4,Aafter outcry
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents overlooking the park had said
OL,7,Fthey feared developing the land would
OL,8,Fundermine the value of their homes, one
OL,9,Fsaying losing the park would "change
OL,10,Fthe character" of the area.
